    "Puzzle2dFillRun": {
      "title": "Puzzle2dFillRun",
      "description": "The fill tool run vocabulary of `s.puzzle2d`'s ✏️editor/⏳️precompute/🪣️fill run job: stage and counter indices, reason codes with their tool-run verdict and EN/DE templates, the policies and the fixed little-endian checkpoint layout. Ticket 26/09/13/INTERACTIVE-TOOLS-VISIBLE-PROCESS lane W2-A.",
